{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2023-04-21 09:00:00', 'title': 'DUPONT WINS THREE 2023 EDISON AWARDS™', 'text': 'TWO SILVER AWARDS AND ONE BRONZE HIGHLIGHT SUSTAINABLE TECHNOLOGIES WILMINGTON, DEL. , APRIL 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUPONT (NYSE:DD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THREE OF ITS INNOVATIVE MATERIAL TECHNOLOGIES WERE RECOGNIZED WITH THE PRESTIGIOUS 2023 EDISON AWARDS™.'}